# Kernel calls that give way at every window and resume (roadmap os-server.md P3,
# TEST_GIVE_WAY): tests/programs/additions.asm.
program: additions
define: TEST_CAPS
define: TEST_ADD_RESUME
emulators: bochs mame
match: contains
timeout: 120
---
additions: a line written a byte a turn
additions: the call gave way (1): 1
additions: its bytes (40): 40
additions: the call gave way (1): 1
additions: a 64 KB retype, giving way (0): 0
additions: the pattern left in it (0): 0
additions: the call gave way (1): 1
additions: a revoke of ten copies, giving way (0): 0
additions: the copies' slots empty after it (0): 0
additions: the call gave way (1): 1
additions: a delete that empties a space, giving way (0): 0
additions: its slot empty (1): 1
additions: done
